{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもー♪\nこんばんはヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新回数のゾロ目が\n近づいてます(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し楽しみ...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しなんかいっ￣O￣)ﾉ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/04/28/5909277/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうGWですね～(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん楽しんでますか？(｀・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこか遠くに出かけたり\nお家でゆっくり♪ってのも\nいいですなぁ_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏はね～、お休みが出来たら\n旅行したいヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんま遠くじゃなくて\n近場の温泉へGOΣ(σ`･ω･´)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばね、また\nあるメンバーのお話が\nあるから聞いて聞いてっ(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのメンバーは楽屋で\nアイスを食べていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに真夏も食べてたの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってどーでもいいですね！\nすみませぬ(*￢ε￢*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら『カチャンッ』\n何かが落ちる音がしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだ？！と思って\n音のする方をみると..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの子が椅子に座ったまま\nバタンっと倒れかけている！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして床にはスプーンが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一体何が起きたというのか...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お、サスペンスっぽく\nなってきましたね～(-ω-ﾒ)わくわく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん推理するんですよ♪"},{